[bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the current period strip and make colors follow identity[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip_polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip_polish: plugin-only fixes on today's strip (legend hues, legend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rank, tick baselines, honest heights, year values, so-far, tooltip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels), isolate period strips from the Day strip switch, and make the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared root/type color passes identity-ordered.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Configured task-type minutes in Stats[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]type_split[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]type_split: add a task_type parts dimension to Pomodoro metrics that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]splits each session's counted minutes over its configured types only, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with unnamed and label-only buckets, plus docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob periods show charts and stacks contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]period_charts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after type_split[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]period_charts: parse stats.period_strip.top_roots, emit charts plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-column and per-child stacks and display_short, fix long-period [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage copy, document the contract, and set top_roots 5 in chezmoi.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two-chart period strip painter and its own switch[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chart_painter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip_polish, period_charts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chart_painter: paint Roots above Types on one shared axis from bob's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]charts and stacks, with legend titles, identity hues, honest geometry, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the period-only switch and command, the older-bob fallback, tests, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]week/quarter previews.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Year and all-time density, parts table, polish, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]long_periods[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chart_painter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]long_periods: year and all-time density rules, the measured year [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback, all-time untracked collapse, parts-table mini-bars, legend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hover dimming, forced colors, the full preview matrix, docs, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-js","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-js.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-js.1"},"source_run_id":"run-5b568011727627e54d61e589a3ddb0af","started_at":"2026-11-10T16:50:36.060053+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"863a5dff2a3d0ab571327cfc887c923a0be6f68f47a8162ec285ef7bfa829798","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"756f7952e2e2c7cb84710c0414444fc3e9b7894d3e18e9084031241401575370","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.land/meta.json","size_bytes":716},"prompt":{"digest":"094881e3556c2d1607f289e931ddd5d75dcfcdd05d9b48c428a98da31af22dcc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":309},"state":{"digest":"95658c75f4fcdb0ee0aa119784e6eb